WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:11.070
I'm Mars's doctor. I put a stethoscope — a seismometer — on the ground and listened.

2
00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:18.310
I heard more than 1,300 marsquakes and the thump of meteoroids hitting the surface.

3
00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:22.420
They told us Mars has a liquid metal core.

4
00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:27.960
Dust covered my solar panels until I couldn't stay awake any longer.

5
00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:34.200
I listened to Mars shake, 1,319 times.
